====== Multilaser RE027 ======

{{section>meta:infobox:432_warning#infobox_for_dataentries&noheader&nofooter&noeditbutton}}

Also know as Multilaser RE039, this is a **rebranded** [[:toh:tp-link/tl-wr741nd|TP-Link TL-WR741ND v1]] from Multilaser (brazilian vendor), and will only accept firmwares with Multilaser vendor ID bytes (in the file header).\\ Other compatible firmwares(TP-Link, OpenWRT, Gargoyle, DD-WRT) use different vendor IDs, or does not come with those bytes (which are needed for switching the stock firmware, otherwise you will get TP-Link **error 18005**).

